{"server":"tw","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_02_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_02","title":"偶然","storyCode":"DM-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"1b4c95e03c442ea84135b6ce2d431d8a37f727916a9b4b5e57c5773cf3e39231","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾北面，有一片樺樹林。\n那裡屬於生命的時間，從春天開始，到入冬結束。\n而漫長的隆冬只有死亡，所有生命都不約而同地離開那裡，只有裸露在地表上的源石結晶反射著月光。\n......灰白色的樹幹，細長的影子在雪地上交叉重疊，了無生氣。\n那就是我看到的景色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......伊內絲！\n......伊內絲！嘖！\n......該死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果可以醒過來，就麻煩你早點醒過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（頭......好痛......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是......什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼情況，不過為了防止你剛才摔到失憶，我可以提醒你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"一個小時前我們遭到伏擊，敵人很迅速，術師來不及構築法術工事，隊伍被打散了，附近就我們兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"被干擾了，不知道什麼手段，對方很專業，比以往任何一個獵物都要專業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不過好消息是，對方沒有朝著護送目標去，看來他們只是捕風捉影地找到了一點小消息，其實一無所知呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......繼續行動，想辦法和其他人會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀？我還以為你至少會懷疑我兩句呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我會把你留下來做活餌哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得現在我和你打，誰會活下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖——你還真是，性格惡劣，你一眼就確認了我的傷勢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......原來你這麼疼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你連自己的情緒波動都能偽裝得像模像樣，一瞬間擔心了一下，看來是多餘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——你醒來第一件事就是用你的源石技藝觀察隊友嗎？還真是充滿信任啊，隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原來如此，睜眼的第一刻就要警惕周圍，真是個膽小鬼啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過活餌，對吧？是個不錯的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著一個站都站不穩的傭兵行動才是犯蠢，你就留下吧，我會幫你通知周圍的敵人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好和他們愉快相處，不要死得太快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭見，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"最後說一句，我根本沒信任過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你這——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......發現傭兵，一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"確認對方代號，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，其實你們一直都跟著我們......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑你們這些人的身手，放走一兩人根本不足為懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，本想跟著監視你們直到發現本隊，沒想到竟然拋下同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"把那支隊伍的資訊全部告訴我，你可以死得痛快點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這下可麻煩了呀......我其實是很樂意坦誠相待的，但我真的什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你受傷不輕，我們時間也不多，倉促的拷問可能致死，對我們都不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你去追那個女人啊，她知道的比我多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......她把你當誘餌，你就不恨她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"和我們合作，痛快得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......誘餌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你......用工業源石碎屑引誘過源石蟲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只是卡茲戴爾的一個偏方啦，經常會因為源石蟲遇到很多麻煩不是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"野生的源石蟲智力很低，據說會對源石有反應——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過真假姑且不論，你知道那些被引誘過來的蟲子，會是什麼下場嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別故弄玄虛——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就會像你埋伏在後方的同伴那樣，被炸得稀爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"什——什麼時候！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都說了是“活餌”了，會沒有陷阱嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你該早點下殺手，或者乾脆逃跑。現在再給你一次機會，我們重新來一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——這麼快！？原來你們一直在追蹤我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你這瘋子！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——背後——誰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"小點聲，別亂動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只是把外行人也揮得動的細劍，但我可不是什麼劍術大師，一失手，你就會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你什麼時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我和陰影的親和力可是很高的，你真的以為一個偵查員都不帶就能抓到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"來，告訴我，你的主人是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"輕點，你把別人的五臟六腑都攪翻了還怎麼讓人說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾的——不會——原諒你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（卡茲戴爾......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是完全不擅長拷問啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......真遺憾，你還活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可以等他把我解決掉再對他下手的，你也太著急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，比起你，當然是碾死他們比較優先，這些蟲子讓我蒙受了多少損失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"應當死在我手下的敵人已經露出破綻，哪一個雇傭兵還按捺得住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你，還挺像個薩卡茲的不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"耳濡目染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的動靜挺大，應該會吸引不少敵人過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是正好嗎？能讓他們遠離目標隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"他說放走一兩個......就是說其他人都死了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"這種水準根本解決不了那麼多同僚，何況他在畏懼，戰場上......有別的什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的傷，真的是裝的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，再怎麼說傷口可是實打實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我沒那麼在意罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你啊，真的憑醒過來那一眼，就能知道我已經把給他們的小禮物準備好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒醒，就輪到我做活餌了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定會等到你死了再收網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一天，你遇上一個真的能看清你內心思緒的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你大概不會是她的對手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，那我拭目以待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"開始了，用你的法術再偵測一下附近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"別，你擺這臉色，一般證明我們都沒好下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說的沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"可是逃也逃不掉，硬著頭皮上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你不擅長正面作戰，那豈不是只有我上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"先往西邊走，和赫德雷的隊伍會合之後也許能有轉機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"要是沒能會合呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我們都活不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"護衛隊伍已經殲滅過半，但是，沒能在運輸隊伍抵達A5集合點前攔截住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"誘餌有很多......幾支護衛最周全的隊伍都只是煙霧彈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛是巴別塔執意劍走偏鋒，要嘛......是本隊根本不需要保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，不能再拖了，必須速戰速決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"本以為把清掃後續交給那些亡命之徒就夠了......沒想到他們連這點事都辦不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"看來雇傭兵之中水準起伏也很大，赫德雷的小隊比想像中要強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"若非被對方先一步找上......也許可以為我們所用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"要繼續追？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可前面也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，將軍，在所不辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟丟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"分頭去，你們，東邊，我西邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傢伙，好像，的確不太好惹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你說，躲好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，從剛開始你就沒停下過，你會瞎的，眼睛不痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，痛，但至少得找一條出口——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿——咿啊啊——不，不要——我投降——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，清脆俐落的劈砍聲，看到他們的身手了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只是偽裝成雇傭兵而已，他們根本不是什麼雇傭兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"少說幾句！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就算沒有其他埋伏了，光現在能在廢墟中確認到身影的這幾個傢伙，就完全打不贏啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——你想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"都什麼時候了，怎麼還要監視我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是還沒瞎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你抱著那麼多......那是弩手的榴彈？你要做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你想和他們同歸於盡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"能殺一個是一個，很正常的想法吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"別送死，這沒有意義——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們活著又有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲果然都是瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你不是瘋子，所以我也從來都不信任你啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，W！等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，發現一人，W，榜上有名呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"用手投擲爆炸範圍如此之大的源石榴彈，真是讓人大開眼界的魯莽方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼做到的？我的隊友一瞬間就被火焰吞沒了，你自己倒是沒事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，熟能生巧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......將軍會很中意你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"放棄抵抗吧，把巴別塔交給你們的任務悉數告知，你們會有別的地方可以大放光彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你憑什麼信任我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我憑什麼信任你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"很聰明的先後順序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"雇傭兵是一種戰爭工具，如果我們要互相競爭，當然是要把順手的工具掌握在自己手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，應該是方便的一次性消耗品才對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便你怎麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"還有躲藏在四點鐘十七米方向的那個，擅長偵測法術的雇傭兵，你也想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"先把你的刀放下，你沒有勝算，當然如果你想試試，也可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......情報吻合，W，伊內絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的隊伍已經覆滅近八成，剩下的殘兵敗將，就像這個人一樣，不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腳下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這些殘塊曾經是個完整的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎？你們面對的不是普通的雇傭兵，也不是什麼殺手，刺客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，算上你們的領袖，你們三個人，其中任意兩個人聯手，殺死第三者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"帶著任何一個人的頭顱回到這裡，所有損失和責任都算在那個死人頭上，我們會接納剩下的生還者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，這並不是我的主意，但我們也要給喪生的戰士們一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是在戰場上招安，也許我們會合作得更加愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......承蒙厚愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"很不幸，我不擅長戰鬥，我多半是贏不了這個噁心的女人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"突然很誠實嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，所以剩下的選擇，就是我們兩個聯手，殺了赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我想聽聽......雇傭兵們執意送死的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想站在被戲弄性命的那一方，我覺得還是戲弄別人的性命比較有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也不太想聽你擺佈啊，怎麼說，你出的這種低級難題也太無聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，至於這位眼睛快瞎掉也快氣瘋掉的小羊羔呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟她不是薩卡茲嘛，你踩到她的雷區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——你們知道會是什麼下場的，這場仗你們已經打輸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"下場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不知道哎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你真的要去嗎？艦船已經近在眼前了。\n嗯，沒有想到他們這麼快就察覺到了，是情報人員的失誤嗎。\n至少有雇傭兵衛隊在。\n我們讓那些戰士身陷他們所不知情的危險。\n雇傭兵本來就是如此，我們應當......也遲早要背負這些。\n我能救下他們，救下一些會因為我們的失策而不知真相死去的戰士。\n......我不否認，特蕾西婭，但是——\n沒有任何一個薩卡茲、沒有任何一個人，有理由白白犧牲。\n......唉......那我和你一起去。\n嗯，謝謝你——\n——凱爾希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，果然還有援兵嗎......這些人到底是什麼來頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，別嚇昏過去啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......保持意識有點......困難......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你還會說抱歉......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"上次我看著昏倒的你......這次輪到你幫幫忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，別那麼小氣......我就稍微......休息一會....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"十四、十五......不，更多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"有序無聲，是專業的......不，是比我們還要更加熟悉戰場的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡茲戴爾......哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊......聽......有人.....\n有人......去救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊......恢復了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是......什麼感覺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在靠近......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——伊內絲！W呢？你們現在的座標在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭開始前......你在卡茲戴爾......生活過，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道一件事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你受傷了？先穩住氣息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在安全的地方，我們已經向運輸隊本隊申請聯繫援軍——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"先......聽我說，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好的，我在聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的王......失去了卡茲戴爾的那位......殿下她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是個......白髮的女性？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
